  "description": "meme-id: when_each_letter_is_awesome; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a globe surrounded by colorful, stylized human figures in a circular arrangement, with the text 'when each letter is awesome' at the top. The visual metaphor suggests global unity or diversity, with each figure representing a different letter or aspect of global identity. The meme's intent is likely to convey a positive message of inclusivity and appreciation for diversity, using the visual of people around the world to symbolize the 'awesome' nature of each individual or cultural element. There is no evidence of toxicity, abusive, cyberbullying, hateful, misogynous, or propaganda elements in this image. The overall intent is to promote a positive, celebratory message about global diversity and individual uniqueness, without targeting any specific group or community in a harmful way. The meme uses the juxtaposition of the text 'when each letter is awesome' with the visual of diverse human figures to suggest that every part of the world or every individual contributes something valuable and awesome to the whole.",
